Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 698 "[Lemegeton] Carving the Sealing Ring"
    Journal for karus "You must help [Order of the Sorcery] Bros to prepare for sealing devil."
    Journal for elmorad "You must help [Order of the Sorcery] Sais to prepare for sealing devil."
    Collect 1 of 900218000

Requires player level >= 70 and quest 697 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 100000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Thought it was difficult to get the materials, it's got easier than you think.Broth by a tricky magic Phalanx got to pretend to try? Ahem."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I thought it would be much more difficult to get the materials but you did it so easily. Should we pretend to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] that it was difficult to get them? Ahem."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "I have received the materials you collected. However, I can't use them in this state to seal devils."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "First of all, [Elaborated Sealed ring] must be made by using [Ordinary old ring] and [Magical power transmit marble]. There is a great jeweller in Moradon by the name of Jewel, the [Jeweller]. You can get help from him.\n\nYou have to make [Elaborated Sealed ring] using [Ordinary old ring] and [Magical power transmit marble] and bring it to [Jeweller] Juel of Moradon at the request of [Order of the sorcery] Bros, of Ronark Land. \n※ You'll need 200,000 Noahs to make [Elaborated Sealed ring]."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I have received the materials you collected. However, I can't use them in this state to seal devils."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "First of all, [Elaborated Sealed ring] must be made by using [Ordinary old ring] and [Magical power transmit marble]. There is a great jeweller in Moradon by the name of Jewel, the [Jeweller] Juel. You can get help from him.\n\nYou have to make [Elaborated Sealed ring] using [Ordinary old ring] and [Magical power transmit marble] and bring it to [Jeweller] Juel of Moradon at the request of [Order of the sorcery] Seis, of Ronark Land. \n※ You'll need 200,000 Noahs to make [Elaborated Sealed ring]."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Is it finished it yet? Only Jewel, the [Jeweller] of Moradon is able to make [Elaborated Sealed ring]."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Is it finished it yet? Only Jewel, the [Jeweller] Juel of Moradon is able to make [Elaborated Sealed ring]."

On claimable
    Show quest "You did it! So this is the [Elaborated Sealed ring]... Thank you."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "Now, it's time to start sealing [72 Devil]. First seal [24Devil] Naberius and [48Devil] Haagenti. Come back to me once you have eliminated them. Then I will purify the souls imbued into your body, <selfname> and seal them."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Now, it's time to start sealing [72 Devil]. First seal [24Devil] Naberius and [48Devil] Haagenti. Come back to me once you have eliminated them. Then I will purify the souls imbued into your body,<selfname> and seal them."
